    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d721">

                <pb facs="0927" n="915" sameAs="frus:frus1946v07/pg915"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867.51/11–846: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ankara</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1946-11-08T13:00:00+02:00">November 8, 1946—1
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 1:01 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1174. Prime Minister<anchor n="46" xml:id="d721-f1"/> spoke to me yesterday with
                    great earnestness regarding desire obtain additional Eximbank credit. He said <pb facs="0928"
                        n="916" xml:id="pg916"/> 25,000,000 already granted entirely earmarked
                    essential purposes and number other projects vital to Turkish economy require
                    additional funds, such as communications, transport needs, agricultural and
                    mineral development. He hopes very much we can help and said additional credit
                    at present time would be great material and moral assistance to Turkish Govt and
                    people.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d721-f1" n="46" xml:id="d721-f1-content">
                <p>Recep Peker formed a new Turkish Government on August 7.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
